---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="What are some of the benefits and the challenges of elephant tourism?"
  description="Elephants have a new worth working in the tourism industry. Our biggest challenge is educating tourists about the reality of Thai elephants."
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="What are some of the benefits and the challenges of elephant tourism?"
  heroSubtitle="Khao Sok National Park · Field Answer"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Items", "href": "/faq-items/"}, {"label": "What Are Some Of The Benefit...", "href": "/faq-items/what-are-some-of-the-benefits-and-the-challenges-of-elephant-tourism/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Benefits mean that <strong>elephants have found a new worth </strong>other than agriculture and work productivity, <strong>receiving better care than ever before</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>Challenges is ignorance of tourists</strong> around <strong>how elephants need to be treated</strong>, and the <strong>high costs of caring for elephants</strong> especially in a non-working setting.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
